<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS forecasts for Swiss economy.</title>
<headline>UBS forecasts for Swiss economy.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland gave</p>
<p>these forecasts for key Swiss economic indicators:</p>
<p>(real pct change vs prvs year unless noted)</p>
<p>					  1995   1996   1997   1998</p>
<p> Gross Domestic Product	   0.1    -0.6    0.0    1.5</p>
<p> - Private consumption	    0.7     0.0   -0.3    0.7</p>
<p> - Public sector consumption   -0.1    -0.5   -2.0   -1.0</p>
<p> - Construction investment     -4.3    -3.3   -2.0    1.2</p>
<p> - Equipment investment	   14.1    8.5    6.0    6.5</p>
<p> - Exports			    3.0     1.8    3.0    4.5</p>
<p> - Imports			    6.6     1.6    2.5    4.0</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (average)    4.2     4.7    5.4    4.8</p>
<p> Inflation rate (average)	 1.8     0.8    0.6    1.5</p>
<p> Trade balance (billion Sfr)    1.8     1.8    2.0    1.5</p>
<p> Current account (billion Sfr) 25.0    24.5   24.2   23.0</p>
<p> Three-month Sfr Eurorates	1.7     2.0    2.5    3.5</p>
<p> Govt bond yields (year end)    3.7     3.9    4.4    4.7</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
